invalid type: string "{\"raw_text\": \"\\u0110\\u1ec3 bi\\u1ebft th\\u00eam th\\u00f4ng tin, \\u0111\\u1ec1 ngh\\u1ecb li\\u00ean h\\u1ec7:\\n\\nPh\\u00f2ng Tr\\u1ed3ng tr\\u1ecdt v\\u00e0 B\\u1ea3o v\\u1ec7 th\\u1ef1c v\\u1eadt\\n\\nNSP-Director@fao.org agriculture/plant-production-and-protection/\\n\\nEmail: NSP-Director@fao.org\\n\\nwww.fao.org/agriculture/plant-production-and-protection/en\\nh